enus_item"><a class="site-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">框架漏洞</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-02-21T12:26:22.000Z" title="发表于 2025-02-21 20:26:22">2025-02-21</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-20T00:20:57.943Z" title="更新于 2025-04-20 08:20:57">2025-04-20</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="框架漏洞"><a href="#框架漏洞" class="headerlink" title="框架漏洞"></a>框架漏洞</h1><h2 id="php框架"><a href="#php框架" class="headerlink" title="php框架"></a>php框架</h2><h3 id="ThinkPHP"><a href="#ThinkPHP" class="headerlink" title="ThinkPHP"></a>ThinkPHP</h3><ul>
<li>远程代码执行：5.x版本存在远程代码执行漏洞</li>
<li>SQL注入：5.1.x中order方法未严格过滤参数。<code>http://ip/index.php?ids[0,updatexml(0,concat(0xa,user()),0)]=1</code></li>
<li>文件包含：存在日志泄露，之后可以包含进行getshell</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Laravel"><a href="#Laravel" class="headerlink" title="Laravel"></a>Laravel</h3><ul>
<li>反序列化：8.x下存在反序列化可造成远程代码执行</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="java框架"><a href="#java框架" class="headerlink" title="java框架"></a>java框架</h2><h3 id="Spring"><a href="#Spring" class="headerlink" title="Spring"></a>Spring</h3><ul>
<li>Spring4shell：数据绑定实现RCE</li>
<li>Spring Security绕过：正则表达式匹配缺陷导致权限绕过。</li>
<li>SPEL表达式注入：表达式解析未过滤用户输入</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Struts2"><a href="#Struts2" class="headerlink" title="Struts2"></a>Struts2</h3><ul>
<li>OGNL表达式注入：CVE-2017-5638，CVE-2020-17530</li>
<li>文件上传：CVE-2017-5638，通过恶意Content-Type触发RCE</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Fastjson"><a href="#Fastjson" class="headerlink" title="Fastjson"></a>Fastjson</h3><ul>
<li>反序列化：1.2.24及以下版本（CVE-2017-18349）、1.2.47的<code>autoType</code>绕过（CVE-2019-20444）。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Apache-Shiro"><a href="#Apache-Shiro" class="headerlink" title="Apache Shiro"></a>Apache Shiro</h3><ul>
<li><p>身份认证绕过：Shiro-682</p>
</li>
<li><p>RememberMe反序列化：Shiro-550，Shiro-721。默认密匙硬编码</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="python框架"><a href="#python框架" class="headerlink" title="python框架"></a>python框架</h2><h3 id="Django"><a href="#Django" class="headerlink" title="Django"></a>Django</h3><ul>
<li>目录遍历（CVE-2022-34265）：<code>http://ip:8000/?date=aaa%27</code></li>
<li>SQL注入（CVE-2021-35042）：聚合查询中的参数过滤缺陷。</li>
<li>CSRF保护绕过：旧版本中<code>@csrf_exempt</code>装饰器误用。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Flask"><a href="#Flask" class="headerlink" title="Flask"></a>Flask</h3><ul>
<li>服务端模板注入（SSTI）：未过滤用户输入的模板内容（如<code>render_template_string</code>）。</li>
<li>调试模式信息泄露：开启调试模式后暴露代码和堆栈信息。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="第三方框架"><a href="#第三方框架" class="headerlink" title="第三方框架"></a>第三方框架</h2><h3 id="Log4j"><a href="#Log4j" class="headerlink" title="Log4j"></a>Log4j</h3><ul>
<li>Log4Shell：JNDI注入导致RCE，影响2.0-beta9至2.14.1版本。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Ruoyi"><a href="#Ruoyi" class="headerlink" title="Ruoyi"></a>Ruoyi</h3><ul>
<li>未授权访问：部分接口权限校验缺失</li>
<li>SQL注入：历史版本中<code>orderBy</code>参数未过滤</li>
<li>默认口令：<code>admin/admin123</code></li>
